NOT IN THIS DIFF, deliberately:
  · no change to `definitions.edge` — the shared ref pattern stays as it is.
  · no change to `accessibility.relatedSC` — the 17 proposed WCAG rules land with
    applies_to: [] and it stays that way until a meta names one, which is a
    separate authored pass, not this one.
  · no new top-level property. `properties` keeps its 34 keys.
